### Pillar 7: 🔄 Connected Learning Loop

**What JARVIS does**: Every interaction makes JARVIS better at serving Tony. Not through explicit training — through observation.

**What to build**:

#### [NEW] `core_ai/src/ai_assistant/core/learning_loop.py` — Unified Learning Orchestrator

Your project has 50 AI files with learning capabilities that are mostly disconnected. Build one orchestrator:

```python
class LearningLoop:
    """
    Connects all the disconnected learning modules into a single feedback loop.
    """
    
    def after_every_interaction(interaction: Interaction):
        """Called after EVERY user interaction"""
        
        # 1. Update User DNA
        user_dna.update_from_interaction(interaction)
        
        # 2. Update Memory
        jarvis_memory.remember_automatically(interaction)
        
        # 3. Update Usage Patterns
        usage_pattern_analyzer.record(interaction)
        
        # 4. Update Command Predictions
        smart_command_predictor.learn(interaction)
        
        # 5. Update Emotional Baseline
        emotional_intelligence.update_baseline(interaction)
        
        # 6. Update Proactive Triggers
        proactive_anticipator.learn_trigger(interaction)
        
        # 7. Track success/failure for self-healing
        if interaction.had_error:
            self_healing_engine.learn_failure(interaction)
